  "_reading": "A teacher's own retrieval quality does not predict the quality of the table distilled from it, and its correlation with APPROXIMABILITY is negative: the better the tower, the harder a bag of token vectors finds it. Selecting a teacher on MTEB score or on a symmetric probe is therefore selecting on close to the wrong thing -- which is what this project did until 2026-08-26."
